Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.41,0:00:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.81,0:00:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.35,0:00:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for, Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.81,0:01:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting for you to\Ncome to your senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.73,0:01:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She's lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.89,0:01:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How can she side with the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.79,0:01:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all because of that Ori Calcos thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.51,0:01:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now one of them will lose their soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.97,0:01:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.67,0:01:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you see you're letting\Nthat magic card control you, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.95,0:01:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're putting your own life in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.15,0:01:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't go through with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.99,0:01:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.77,0:01:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But the puzzle is powerless\Nagainst that seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.07,0:01:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.69,0:01:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit mumbling to yourself\Ndown there, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.51,0:01:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you didn't realize this last time,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.19,0:01:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing can break the seal of Auriculcose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.81,0:01:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Once it appears, it doesn't disappear\Nuntil a soul's been captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.35,0:01:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't think you're\Noff the hook, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.95,0:01:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as the girl takes your\Nfriend's soul, I'm taking yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.69,0:01:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back in your cage, gorilla boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.45,0:02:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, when I'm done with Wheeler, Yugi\Nbelongs to me. But why? She's nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.53,0:02:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I never liked her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.05,0:02:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.37,0:02:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Any more lip from Mai, and she's next.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.43,0:02:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, give the girl a break, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.87,0:02:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,She's still new at all this, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.13,0:02:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, she's gonna keep when she\Ngets mad, don't you think? Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.49,0:02:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,When are you gonna make\Nyour move, hotshot?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.81,0:02:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This year would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.47,0:02:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.47,0:02:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna duel against you, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.59,0:02:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Afraid you're not good enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.03,0:02:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Afraid you're gonna lose\Nlike you did in Battle City?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.07,0:02:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known you'd back down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.55,0:02:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm afraid I'm gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.23,0:02:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if I do, you're gonna pay\Nfor it by giving up your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.33,0:02:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.79,0:02:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.27,0:02:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you the Mai you knew is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.33,0:02:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I traded in her soul for power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.15,0:02:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The old Mai was too lonely and pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.47,0:02:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The girl was just holding me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.79,0:02:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So I did what I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.93,0:02:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent her packing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.61,0:03:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my weak side's gone for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.07,0:03:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I happen to have liked the old\Nmine, and I'm gonna get her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.03,0:03:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.61,0:03:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna go through with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.91,0:03:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.25,0:03:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.83,0:03:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My move!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.74,0:03:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll start by summoning\NAlligator's Sword in Defense Mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.79,0:03:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to figure out a strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.91,0:03:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty lame move. Now watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.37,0:03:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's how you play the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.57,0:03:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Harpy Lady in Attack Mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.95,0:03:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes two!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.83,0:03:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to the Seal of\NOrikalkos, she gets 500 more points!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.21,0:03:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Harpy Lady, attack now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.27,0:03:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, my second harpy lady\Nwill attack your life point
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.21,0:04:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.12,0:04:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,no I can't watch Not if\NJoey is gonna lose this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.91,0:04:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Duel on purpose? So he can\Nsave mine? Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.05,0:04:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Would Joey really throw the duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.09,0:04:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But if he does that, he'll\Nlose his own soul Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.79,0:04:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I know But this wouldn't be the first time\NThat Joey risked his life to save mine
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.31,0:04:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Joey, don't be a hero. Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.79,0:04:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,look i'm staying right here hang in there
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.39,0:04:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time we stepped in and saved them\Nboth. Yeah, but this time the force
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.09,0:04:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,we're up against is too strong we\Ncan't stop it don't give up yet we
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.05,0:04:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,May have something that's capable of\Ndefeating this evil power. I'm just
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.99,0:04:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,not sure how we can use it to save\Njoey what is it the eye of timias
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.51,0:05:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,if the pharaoh thinks he\Ncan use his new dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.61,0:05:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,friend to get out of this\Nhe better think again
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.19,0:05:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,your move mike i knew\Nyou'd be easy to beat
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.79,0:05:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,but i didn't think you'd be this easy now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.49,0:05:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,let's see how you deal with my face down\Ncard my guess is you'll run away screaming
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.31,0:05:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,this is a bad sign guys\Nwhoa what do you think
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.69,0:05:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,happened here a gas station\Nexploded you premiack
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.91,0:05:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,wait a sec yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.63,0:05:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,if i have whiplash you're gonna hear from
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.19,0:05:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,my liars listen i've\Ngot a hunch guys hold on
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.53,0:05:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.21,0:05:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Lean over the side!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:06:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to contact Pegasus, but there's no\Nsignal from industrial illusions at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.73,0:06:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling that would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.81,0:06:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.47,0:06:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever Alistair's working for must have\Nalready gotten their hands on Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.31,0:06:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And if that's true, I'm sure our new\Nfriends will be expecting us. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.43,0:06:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that we're\Nabout to fly right into a trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.93,0:06:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I want them to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.71,0:06:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm always one step ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.79,0:06:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Play this card, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.05,0:06:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I play Fang of Critias!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.89,0:06:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no such card, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.91,0:06:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what do you call this, Alistair?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.57,0:06:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This dragon seems to be just as\Npowerful as the Egyptian god.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.71,0:06:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,cards but why have i never even\Nheard of it before kaiba corpse
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.41,0:06:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,database contains every card\Never made except this one hey
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.57,0:07:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,seto are you okay i'm fine mokuba\Nnow let's go crash this party
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.83,0:07:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My harpies are waiting, Wheeler. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.17,0:07:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,what am i supposed to do if i fight my
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.63,0:07:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,hardest and win i lose mine forever but\Nif i let her win i lose myself forever
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.27,0:07:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I guess I missed a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.43,0:07:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wise guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.69,0:07:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe Mai\Nchose those clowns over us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.87,0:07:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what they\Ndid, but I'm gonna undo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.43,0:07:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Just make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.93,0:07:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm bored, and so are my harpies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.39,0:07:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.15,0:07:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.47,0:07:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This should buy me some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.77,0:07:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll start by summoning Rocket\NWarrior in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.19,0:08:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll throw in a little\Nface-down action and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.13,0:08:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.93,0:08:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like your boyfriend's\Nafraid to attack my... Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.21,0:08:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to finish him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.85,0:08:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a backseat duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.69,0:08:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I can handle this by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.07,0:08:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.98,0:08:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.77,0:08:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, where was I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.17,0:08:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.31,0:08:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I was about to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.87,0:08:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you're with\Nthem, you can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.71,0:08:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.01,0:08:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to find a way to save us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.73,0:08:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And you called me crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.77,0:08:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, my Harpy Lady,\Nattack his Rocket Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.71,0:08:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for Harpy Lady number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.65,0:08:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his Life Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.17,0:08:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.37,0:08:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll lose the duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.51,0:08:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.05,0:08:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Not with this face-down card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.93,0:08:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Scapegoat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.25,0:08:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, but you won't be\Ntouching my life points right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.17,0:08:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna have to disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.23,0:09:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a face-down card, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.67,0:09:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Nightmare Tri-Mirror. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.41,0:09:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.95,0:09:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen that card before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.13,0:09:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,My mirror will transform the reflection of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.75,0:09:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,your scapegoats into\Nmore harpy ladies for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.93,0:09:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And since you have four scapegoats, Scapegoats,\NI gained four more harpies. Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.03,0:09:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.83,0:09:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Mai will have enough monsters to destroy\NJoey's scapegoats and his life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.25,0:09:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.07,0:09:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,She can't have six monsters in play.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.83,0:09:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, Tristan, thanks\Nto the seal of Orykalcos,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.93,0:09:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai is allowed to have up to ten\Nmonsters on the field at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.91,0:09:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,D 'oh, stupid magic thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.69,0:09:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this is what I call girl power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.01,0:10:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're up against six harpy ladies all\Nenhanced with the power of my magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.37,0:10:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one card face down on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.75,0:10:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It was nice knowing ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.11,0:10:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got six harpy ladies\Nand one big magic circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.77,0:10:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And we all agree you're in\Nover your head, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.33,0:10:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky for you, it's your move,\Nor I'd finish you off right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.07,0:10:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.99,0:10:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing he can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.97,0:10:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai backed Joey into a corner,\Nand now he's stuck there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.51,0:10:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan's got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.03,0:10:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If Joey doesn't do something quick,\NMai's gonna win the duel. That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.13,0:10:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And as long as the seal of\NOrykalkos is on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.05,0:10:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai has all sorts of advantages.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.55,0:10:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It even seems as though\Nthere are certain magic
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.49,0:10:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and trap cards that only\Nshe is allowed to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.41,0:10:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you asked for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.55,0:10:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.01,0:10:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Panda Warrior in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.53,0:11:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I sacrifice one scapegoat\Nso my panda can attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.73,0:11:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I reveal my face-down card.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.83,0:11:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Harpy Lady Sparrow Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.01,0:11:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.19,0:11:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My Harpy Ladies have all joined\Nforces to repel your attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.41,0:11:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't have that card back\Nin Battle City. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.49,0:11:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems as though she's\Ngone through more than
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.49,0:11:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,a few changes since the\Nlast time we saw her,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.15,0:11:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,including a stronger deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.93,0:11:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.01,0:11:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what kind of spell these\Nguys put on you, but you gotta wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.37,0:11:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, we're both gonna\Nbe in pretty big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.65,0:11:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What spell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.99,0:11:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's controlling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.21,0:11:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two lackeys up there\Ncouldn't control my left pinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.79,0:12:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I was sick of my life,\Nso I chose to change it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.97,0:12:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. How could you? You guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.29,0:12:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,wouldn't understand you've never been
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.07,0:12:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,an outsider like me all alone duel\Nmonsters is all i have and after the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.27,0:12:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,battle city tournament i set out\Nto become the best i dueled against
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.81,0:12:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,chump after chump to improve my dueling\Nskills i needed to make a name for
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.41,0:12:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Myself, Dry Horn Dragon, attack\Nher Harpy Lady! Activate face down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.47,0:12:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Card, my Mirror Wall cuts your\NDragon's attack points in half. That's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.47,0:12:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,what you think i activate my\Nface down card it's called rush
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.91,0:12:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,recklessly it gives my monster 700
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.83,0:12:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,extra points guess i win better guess
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.77,0:12:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,again, Sporto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.99,0:12:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.49,0:12:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.53,0:13:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called Fairy's Hand\NHero, and it transfers
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.29,0:13:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,the effect of your magic\Ncard to my heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.47,0:13:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.65,0:13:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner by a nose is my
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.13,0:13:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Valentine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I won match after match, I\Ndidn't feel any stronger as a duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.31,0:13:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact i felt worse and i\Ncertainly wasn't making a
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.49,0:13:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,name for myself good dueling\Nout there who'd you play
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.67,0:13:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,again someone valentine\Nhuh yeah she came in like
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.03,0:13:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,eighth place or something\Nin duelist kingdom i almost
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.11,0:13:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,beat her too so it's not\Nlike she's one of the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.07,0:13:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,famous ones like kaiba or\Nthat yugi kid joey wheeler's
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.71,0:13:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,always been my favorite\Nhe's so cute in a tough guy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.43,0:13:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,kind of way those guys could\NDuel circles around us,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.61,0:13:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but this Valentine girl,\Nshe's not in their league.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.93,0:13:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.49,0:13:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I feel kind of lame for losing to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.87,0:14:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that tonight's winning trophy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.07,0:14:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't think... Uh, oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.89,0:14:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Not too long after that,\Nthe nightmare started.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.41,0:14:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, you're weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.07,0:14:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't belong in this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'm banishing you into the deepest\Nshadows where you'll spend all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.77,0:14:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.69,0:14:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.89,0:14:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.77,0:14:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone, anyone, help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.31,0:14:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.67,0:14:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.39,0:14:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, please, rescue me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.91,0:14:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Every night it was the same dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.41,0:14:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I was weak and no one\Nwas there to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.17,0:15:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I was at the end of my rope. Scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.71,0:15:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.95,0:15:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.95,0:15:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And my so-called friends\Nwere nowhere to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.25,0:15:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.09,0:15:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm never going to get\Nwhat I deserve anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.05,0:15:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you. You're my valentine,\Nright? Who wants to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.41,0:15:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your next dueling opponent.\NSo am I. What'll it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.69,0:15:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Try your dueling skills\Nagainst me Or stand
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.99,0:15:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,here in the rain feeling\Nsorry for yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.29,0:15:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're weak don't you you think\Nyou don't belong in this world leave
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.27,0:15:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,me alone relax will ya i just want to be
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.81,0:15:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,the best what you want is true power true
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.33,0:16:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,power right and i know how you can get\Nit but the first thing you need to do is
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.59,0:16:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,stop expecting your friends to rescue you\Nall those blokes seem to do is disappoint
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.05,0:16:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.79,0:16:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The answer to all your problems is\Nright around the corner. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.07,0:16:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is take my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.77,0:16:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be the most\Npowerful duelist on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.83,0:16:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.91,0:16:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the smartest decision of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.89,0:16:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I stopped whining like a loser\Nand started taking control.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.93,0:16:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now nothing can stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.27,0:16:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I never knew you felt that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.51,0:16:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell us\Nyou were so unhappy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.83,0:16:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We could have helped you, Mai. Save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.55,0:16:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need your kind of help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.59,0:16:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,All I need now is power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.65,0:16:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm about to unleash all of it on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.11,0:16:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Harpy Lady Phoenix Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.69,0:16:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I have six harpies on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.21,0:17:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,it lets me destroy up\Nto six of your monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.61,0:17:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.93,0:17:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's only got three left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.67,0:17:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That means once Mai's Harpy Lady's\Nattack, he'll be defenseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.33,0:17:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.07,0:17:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai's magic card will\Nalso subtract the sum of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.53,0:17:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's monster's attack\Npoints from his life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.27,0:17:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Harpy Lady, unite and\Ndestroy every one of his monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.85,0:17:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to your\Nthree monsters, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.17,0:17:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone is one attack away\Nfrom losing their soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.29,0:17:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and I don't think it's me, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.03,0:17:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Any last requests?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.31,0:17:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai's got 4,000 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.75,0:17:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,She hasn't even lost one!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.63,0:17:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And Joey's down to his last 200!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.31,0:17:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention the fact\Nthat he's out of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.95,0:18:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If he doesn't think of something\Nright now, he's gonna lose the duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.47,0:18:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, is there anything he can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.91,0:18:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He must find a way to break\Nthe seal of Orichalcos.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.97,0:18:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The magic within that card has\Ninfused Mai with a powerful force.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.31,0:18:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And unless Joey stops it,\Nthe seal will consume him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.49,0:18:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.85,0:18:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If he does that, then\Nwon't Mai lose her soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.79,0:18:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be a way for Joey\Nto win this duel and save Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.59,0:18:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That kid stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.35,0:18:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he didn't even put up a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.25,0:18:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and according to the hype, he's\Nsupposed to be good at this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.17,0:18:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.13,0:18:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Darts wants the\Nsouls of strong duelists.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.21,0:18:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.27,0:18:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm officially out of ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.55,0:18:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind that black leather and\Nnasty attitude is my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.97,0:18:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's no way I'm going to\Nfight back and risk losing her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.27,0:18:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,With 200 life points left,\Nthere's no way I can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.07,0:19:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I give up my soul to save\Nhers, maybe she'll see the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.61,0:19:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.11,0:19:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.21,0:19:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.33,0:19:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Forfeiting is not the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.19,0:19:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If you give up the duel, you're giving\Nup on yourself and your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.21,0:19:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to save\NMai, then keep fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.79,0:19:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.27,0:19:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, because right now Mai is driven\Nby anger, jealousy, and hatred.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.85,0:19:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So you need to remind her\Nwhat dueling is truly about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.43,0:19:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust, conviction, and heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.55,0:19:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.93,0:19:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot what really matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.19,0:19:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot the heart of the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.13,0:19:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's still on, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.39,0:19:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And from now on, I'm\Ngiving it everything I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.71,0:19:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.39,0:19:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to show you what\Ntrue dueling is all about!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.11,0:20:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
